    "about": "The results card's words for a session (format.Title, format.Result, format.KindLabel), which podium's card and the pit wall's API (twr.pitwall.v1.Session's title, result and kind_label) both write, so they never name a session differently. Each case calls fn with args and expects out. title's arg is a twr.events.v1.SessionSummary in protobuf's JSON form; result's are the summary, the session's EndReason, whether it has ended, and the last lap seen (null: from the summary's laps); kindLabel's are a SessionType and the race's laps. A case with v1 says where v1 1.0.0 gave the same out: a recording and session of podium's internal/card/testdata (the card v1's post --dry-run printed), pitwall/data.py (v1's page for a session open or with no full lap), tests/test_results.py, or results.kind_label. A case without one is v2's own: the ranked kind (contracts v0.2.7) and the kinds ecu never sends.",
